  "identity": {
    "text": "I wake at six. I put on a shirt. I put a sock on each foot. My shoe is under the bed. I find it and put it on.\n\nI take a quick look at my note. I start class at ten. Do you start at ten too? We can meet our group at the table.\n\nI finish at three too. Then I leave with you. I take a slow walk to the shop. A short walk helps my body feel ready for the next part of the day.\n\nThat is a good plan. I check my hair before dinner. I do not need the same plan as you. We can each choose our own times.",
